<title>USA: NuCo2 to buy BOC fountain beverage assets.</title>
<headline>NuCo2 to buy BOC fountain beverage assets.</headline>
<text>
<p>STUART, Fla., April 4 - NuCo2 Inc said Thursday it agreed to acquire BOC Group 's retail C02 fountain beverage assets and customer base in the New England, Philadelphia and Nashville markets, involving approximately 1,100 locations.</p>
<p>A purchase price was not disclosed.</p>
</text>
